{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_025_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9d02a8f6cc012f227610a8499d1af0e6464561d2ca4e3e9e9caeb003b2dd7940",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f98de75825c6367f06671c3ff366739bc289d2979948265c0c4e90a494b83f9",
      "text": "哦哦，看起来很好吃的巧克力嘛……不对，是给我的吗！？因为今天是情人节？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f70cf2ccc83f62f0c76b363f30a2ffeb5741b5bb8a0f6a3a6f88d18fcdc7f5d",
      "text": "咕～谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー！……欸，你说什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaeff00237a50acf3a1895fd310a7c5983c0f446e9dc56fba27bab3da47d1f2c",
      "text": "连喵子都有猫咪专用的小零食吗！从这两份礼物里都能感受到十足的干劲啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9e5b34e2b694f7b23b5cf3fa675d47a7d2f53df6c0737bbca1f9eeff4f94404",
      "text": "嘿嘿，收到了这么火热的心意，不燃起来怎么行呢。对吧，喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b8acf9c4df667d2e3fa965bec661d12c5c6009059040b0a4b097a7d45542cf",
      "text": "好嘞，接下来的训练课也要全力以赴上啦！唔哦哦哦哦哦，Burning！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c907605b46028c378e15e228f376d5db4192f951bebb253775c251b24052b9",
      "text": "这个巧克力，是给我的吗？ ●●●●プロデューサー啊，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c421903ea90aca9869ca53a583032ee926a92e00d4331a9754191bfd5ff5f610",
      "text": "居然倾注了PASSION，这可不是普通的巧克力啊。太开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6252517a900a483e34f91150c2fb46e8c42ac6d233dc6fd2c564864145ebffa",
      "text": "虽然以前我对情人节也有过各种各样的想法啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e54d680d93c4d51dde08ab0b3a2844da84cf0edb05eabf5059bc7acf1a1c77ff",
      "text": "但自从遇到制作人、成为偶像之后，我的想法就改变了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e73094be88ac2e34d53d46d75e68533e8c254556d453da8e63e1a3e19f835e",
      "text": "说起来，这种事是那个对吧？要在白色情人节回礼对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fda3830354076ff4409d26c315ea994b1b99689e6771fef87f2edc16e92f76b",
      "text": "我会准备一份火热的回礼的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000046:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b97842fa8ccf5c3b155bb1dfce40f44f2d320cbb5a8cf8252f98275a3ee16d0f",
      "text": "我很期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1580b5d99b78c7e2427250fc3f8e38b314dcd3ed3420332761157db37cb785c2",
      "text": "噢！我会准备能让●●●●プロデューサー的心熊熊燃烧起来的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_025_22:5_01_025_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1580b5d99b78c7e2427250fc3f8e38b314dcd3ed3420332761157db37cb785c2",
      "text": "噢！我会准备能让●●●●プロデューサー的心熊熊燃烧起来的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
